--Description: Confirm the join between BLOCKS and TRANSACTIONS actually returns rows before aggregating.
--We simply pull 20 joined records, show each block’s miner together with one of its transactions
--and the calculated gas fee (gas_price * receipt_gas_used).  No filters on NULL gas fields,
